From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:27:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] FK-16 compatibility candidate (0.3.32-rc.1):
 executor-grants for agent callers without registerAgent
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

NOT A RELEASE CANDIDATE: reverses 0.3.31's tested refusal (test/local-authority.test.ts
'an @authboundry/local without per-agent delegation…' now fails). Pending a decision.
